        Public send result. Deliberately carries only fields we own — never the
        provider's raw response — so switching providers can't change the API.
        Every field is always present (null when not applicable).
      properties:
        conversation_id:
          type: string
          nullable: true
          description: Null only when a proactive send was refused before a conversation
            was resolved.
        message_id:
          type: string
          nullable: true
          description: The platform's message id (e.g. Chatdash/WhatsApp).
